cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the archived release and the
  associated manuscript.
title: >-
  Pelvic-Fracture Arrival Score: code, aggregate tables and web calculator
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, aggregate result tables and figures, and a research-use web
  calculator for the Pelvic-Fracture Arrival Score, a bedside integer score for
  early recognition of major hemorrhage in adults with blunt pelvic-ring
  fracture, derived and internally validated on the National Trauma Data Bank
  (2019 to 2024). No patient-level data are included.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/samersalman/pelvic-fracture-arrival-score'
authors:
  - given-names: Samer G.
    family-names: Salman
    affiliation: 'Baylor College of Medicine, Houston, TX, USA'
keywords:
  - pelvic ring fracture
  - major hemorrhage
  - trauma
  - clinical prediction rule
  - integer risk score
  - shock index
  - National Trauma Data Bank
  - temporal validation
preferred-citation:
